        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Thanks to @ananyo141, I discovered [Snacks](https://github.com/folke/snacks.nvim/tree/main) and smoothly transitioned from [Telescope](https://github.com/nvim-telescope/telescope.nvim) to [Snacks.picker](https://github.com/folke/snacks.nvim/blob/main/docs/picker.md).\n\n```lua\n{\n  'echasnovski/mini.nvim',\n  config = function()\n    require('mini.files').setup()\n\n    ---@module 'snacks'\n    if Snacks then\n      local pick = Snacks.picker.pick\n      ---@type fun(source?: string, opts?: snacks.picker.Config)\n      Snacks.picker.pick = function(source, opts) ---@diagnostic disable-line\n        MiniFiles.close()\n        return pick(source, opts)\n      end\n    end\n\n    vim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\n      pattern = { 'mason', 'lazy' },\n      callback = function()\n        local win = vim.fn.win_getid()\n        files.close()\n        vim.fn.win_gotoid(win)\n      end,\n    })\n  end,\n}\n```\n\n```lua\n{\n  'folke/snacks.nvim',\n  priority = 1000,\n  lazy = false,\n  -- ...\n}\n```",
